			<h2 id="professional-experience">Professional Experience</h2>
			<h3 id="typetura">Co-founder and CEO | <a href="https://typetura.com" target="_blank">Typetura</a></h3>
			<p class="meta">October 2019–Present</p>
			<p>Bootstrapped Typetura, an innovation and design studio, from $0 to over a half-million dollars. Brings an entrepreneurial mindset to build and manage teams and contractors to achieve business success. Defines budgets; sets KPIs; and ensures execution is aligned with strategic priorities. Establishes customer-facing milestones that support brands spanning maturity levels. Under my leadership, Typetura secured multiple patents and deployed ground-breaking typesetting technology to design and launch accessible, beautiful websites and brands for companies ranging in size from small startups to global multinationals.</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Bootstrapped a design and innovation studio from <strong>$0 to over $500k in sales and investment</strong></li>
				<li>Secured <strong>multiple patents for technologies</strong> on dynamic typesetting in partnership with Loeb & Loeb, a multi-national IP firm</li>
				<li>Developed entrepreneurial strategies for product-market fit and customer value creation</li>
				<li>Manage up to <strong>five concurrent projects</strong>, delivering on time and within budget</li>
				<li>Coordinate client stakeholders, business partners, and contractors to achieve company and project goals</li>
			</ul>

			<h3 id="cooper-union">Instructor | <a href="https://coopertype.org" target="_blank">Cooper Union</a></h3>
			<p class="meta">March 2022–Present</p>
			<p>Proposed, formatted, and achieved greenlight from department heads to bring unique, technology-driven offerings to Cooper Union public programs. Administers courses on a semester basis to a wide range of students from industry leaders to early career professionals.</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Maintain a strong curriculum at an internationally renowned design school</li>
				<li>Educate and engage a global audience of students</li>
				<li>Create and build community within the classes, enhancing value for students</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 id="key-projects-and-achievements">Key Projects and Achievements</h2>

			<h3 id="darden-studio"><a href="/work/darden-studio-creating-artifacts-with-fonts/">Darden Studio</a> | Graphic Design and Production</h3>
			<p class="meta">2023–Present</p>
			<p>Continuous partnership with well-respected font foundry Darden Studio to drive sales through branding, packaging, and physical product design. In the Summer of 2024, I identified the success of unique letterform objects as a potential marketing tool and revenue driver for the studio. Worked with studio stakeholders to conceptualize and achieve agreement on creative vision for this business vertical. Designed and oversaw the successful launch of this vertical, in November 2024.</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Creates a marketing direction for the brand, <strong>increasing website traffic by 17%</strong></li>
				<li><strong>Manages vendors</strong> to ensure products are delivered to our standards and within budget</li>
				<li>Works with CEO and partners to identify revenue sources as the studio diversifies its interests</li>
				<li>Sets quarterly goals with senior leaders and ensures their implementation in collaboration with contractors</li>
			</ul>

			<h3 id="we-distribute"><a href="/work/we-distribute/">WeDistribute</a> | Branding and Web Design</h3>
			<p class="meta">2024</p>
			<p>Revitalized WeDistribute, positioning them as the leader in covering distributed social platforms. Led brand positioning exercises with founders, identifying color schemes, typography, and treatments that would solidify their market position and achieve audience awareness. Designed and developed an implementation strategy, customizing its WordPress theme to bring forward core attributes.</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Repositioned the brand as the leader in their space</li>
				<li>Cultivated <strong>stakeholder alignment</strong> through cultivating comprehensive design research and <strong>brand positioning</strong> exercises</li>
				<li>Developed and executed a successful <strong>brand launch strategy</strong> including WordPress theme customization</li>
			</ul>

			<h3 id="el-education"><a href="/work/el-education/">EL Education</a> | Front-End Development</h3>
			<p class="meta">2022</p>
			<p>Modernized the front end of EL Education’s website with a bold new look and highly accessible page architecture. Collaborated with agency Type/Code to integrate their content management system with Typetura’s front-end expertise. Developed and executed the project’s talent strategy, including recruiting, setting market-based compensation, and defining roles with specialized contractors. Led data mapping and the design of easy-to-use, accessible interactive components. Achieved project completion on time and within budget.</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Rebuilt front-end website for global online learning materials provider</li>
				<li>Scaled platform to house over <strong>15,000 pages</strong></li>
				<li>Designed strategy to ensure a <strong>perfect 100 accessibility score</strong> in Google Lighthouse tests</li>
				<li>Managed cross-organizational implementation of complex content infrastructure</li>
				<li>Ensured website accessibility and user engagement</li>
			</ul>

			<h3 id="mariana-tek"><a href="/work/mariana-tek/">Mariana Tek Design System</a> | Project management and design</h3>
			<p class="meta">2018–2019</p>
			<p>Led design on client-side products for Mariana Tek, coordinating with sales, research, product, and development on new features. Multiplied the velocity of the product team 3x by developing a design system, creating a positive feedback loop between sales and product, resulting in the exponential growth of the business from national to global.</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>3x increase in product velocity</strong> with a new design system</li>
				<li>Took the platform global to serve 4 countries worldwide</li>
				<li>Coordinated <strong>stakeholder alignment</strong> across sales, research, product, design, and development</li>
			</ul>

			<h3 id="concert"><a href="https://concert.io">Concert Ad Platform</a> | Prototype, design, and development</h3>
			<p class="meta">2012, 2016–2017</p>
			<p>Created the Concert ad platform at Vox Media, reaching over 90% of the US online audience and driving over $20M YoY in revenue. Driven by the thesis that ads should elevate experiences, I prototyped the ad format. Increasing profitability and scale, I worked to expand the suite of ad products to Condé Nast, Comcast, NBC, and 80+ more publications, while removing the burden on our creative team by standardizing creative formats.</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Drives <strong>$20M+ YoY</strong> in revenue</li>
				<li>Reaches over <strong>90% of the US online audience</strong></li>
				<li>Expanded the suite of ad products to <strong>80+ partners</strong> including NBCUniversal, The Atlantic, Condé Nast, and Hearst Newspapers</li>
				<li>Reaches <strong>230MM uniques</strong></li>
			</ul>

			<h3 id="vox"><a href="/work/vox-launch/">Vox</a> | Founding Design and Front-End Website Development</h3>
			<p class="meta">2014</p>
			<p>Led front-end for the launch of Vox (2014). Achieved launch in 9 weeks, from ideation to release. Managed project scope, exploring high-impact opportunities in working with emerging formats while narrowing scope in other areas. The project culminated in Vox Media’s marquee news vertical.</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Launched Vox Media’s marquee website in just <strong>9 weeks</strong></li>
				<li>Amassed more than <strong>5 million unique visitors in the first month</strong> after launch</li>
				<li><strong>Optimized engagement</strong> by redesigning the home page and feature pages</li>
				<li>Led front-end development ensuring impeccable design and implementation</li>
			</ul>

