			<h2 id="ip">Intellectual Property</h2>
			<h3 id="dynamic-typesetting"><a href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US10769348B1/en" target="_blank">Dynamic Typesetting</a></h3>
			<p class="meta date">US Patent 10769348 and international patents</p>
			<p>This patent describes how typographic systems can be made to adapt to any layout and distributed for use in designs. This means that typesetting, not just fonts, can be distributed to customers independent of layout, optimizing workflows and design quality.</p>

			<h3 id="fluid-design-keyframes"><a href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US10592087B1/en" target="_blank">Fluid Design Keyframes in a GUI</a></h3>
